{{> Start this}}

{{!--
  PREHEADER - the line the inbox list shows next to the subject, and the only
  part of this email a flapping monitor's notifications will ever have read.
  Built from the same facts as the first card row, in plain text (no client
  renders markup here), and hidden from the body. Without it every row in the
  inbox showed the same sentence: "A new alert has been created in the
  project". Same pattern as StatusPageSubscriberReport.hbs.
--}}
<!-- Preheader (hidden inbox preview) -->
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#f3f4f6;opacity:0;">{{preheader}}</div>

{{> Logo this}}
{{> EmailTitle title=(concat "Alert " alertNumber ": " alertTitle) }}

{{!--
  Severity is the "how bad is this" signal and used to render as one more grey
  row indistinguishable from "Declared By". `{{#if}}`, not
  `{{#ifNotCond ... ""}}`: ifNotCond is a strict !== so an ABSENT var would
  pass it and render an empty badge.
--}}
{{#if severityBadgeText}}
{{> SeverityBadge badgeText=severityBadgeText badgeColor=severityColor }}
{{/if}}

{{#if flapWarning}}
{{> WarningBanner text=flapWarning }}
{{/if}}

{{!--
  ORDER ANSWERS, IN THIS SEQUENCE: what broke, why, how bad, is it new, what
  do I do, and only then the fixed per-criteria prose.

  Root Cause used to be seventh and Description eighth, behind five rows that
  are identical in every email this monitor sends - so the only two
  instance-specific lines were the two a reader never reached. "Alert Title:"
  is gone because the 24px headline three lines above it is the same string.
--}}
{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Affected Resource: " plainText=resourcesAffected }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Root Cause: " blockText=rootCause }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Severity: " plainText=alertSeverity }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Current State: " plainText=currentState }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Declared At: " text=declaredAt }}
{{#if monitorName}}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Monitor: " plainText=monitorName }}
{{/if}}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Project: " plainText=projectName }}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Declared By: " plainText=declaredBy }}
{{#ifNotCond remediationNotes ""}}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Remediation Notes: " blockText=remediationNotes }}
{{/ifNotCond}}
{{> DetailBoxField title="Description: " blockText=alertDescription }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}


{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=alertViewLink buttonText="View on Dashboard"}}

{{> InfoBlock info="You can also copy and paste this link:"}}
{{> InfoBlock info=alertViewLink}}

{{> OwnerInfo this }}
{{> UnsubscribeOwnerEmail this }}

{{> Footer this }}

{{> End this}}
